<title>USA: Food Lion Inc Q1 March 22 net rises.</title>
<headline>Food Lion Inc Q1 March 22 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 12 Weeks ended March 22, 1997 and March 23, 1996</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					   12 Weeks	   12 Weeks</p>
<p>				   3/22/97	 3/23/96</p>
<p>				    (A)	     (B)	A%	B%</p>
